@host = http://localhost:5103

### Listar automóviles
GET {{host}}/api/cars
Accept: application/json

### Registrar alquiler con precio
POST {{host}}/api/rentals
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": 1,
    "carId": 1,
    "startDate": "2026-12-10",
    "endDate": "2026-12-14"
}

### Intentar alquilar automóvil ocupado
POST {{host}}/api/rentals
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": 2,
    "carId": 1,
    "startDate": "2026-12-11",
    "endDate": "2026-12-13"
}